ring incense (Tawakkaf ʾǝgziʾo ʾǝṭānana…)" match="t:div" use="t:div"><desc><list><item>Tawakkafetan</item></list></desc></citeStructure><citeStructure xmlns="" unit="Prayer of offering incense (Tawakkaf ʾǝmǝnneya ʾǝgziʾo, ʾana ḫāṭǝʾ wa-ʾabāsi, zanta ʿǝṭāna nǝṣuḥa…) " match="t:div" use="t:div"><desc><list><item>Tawakkafemneya</item></list></desc></citeStructure><citeStructure xmlns="" unit="Prayer for chrism and incense (Nāʾakkʷǝtakka ʾabuhu la-ʾǝgziʾǝna wa-madḫanina ʾIyasus Krǝstos…)" match="t:div" use="t:div"><desc><list><item>Chrism</item></list></desc></citeStructure><citeStructure xmlns="" unit="Prayer of thanksgiving (ʾƎm-mǝśrāq ʾǝska mǝʿrāb yǝtʾakkʷat wa-yǝssebbāḥ sǝmu la-ʾƎgziʾabǝḥer…) " match="t:div" use="t:div"><desc><list><item>Thanksemmesraw</item></list></desc></citeStructure></citeStructure></refsDecl></encodingDesc>
